body:
This PR updates how we subscribe/use the listeners on the Helper. We moved away from [a list of arguments to an object](https://github.com/algolia/algoliasearch-helper-js/pull/700). The PR address those changes on the listeners. It also updates how the `error` event is emitted at the InstantSearch level. It now to match the shape of the Helper.

```js
// With list of arguments
search.on('error', error => {
  console.log(error);
});

// With an object
search.on('error', event => {
  console.log(event.error);
});
```

> The CI does not pass, it's expected. It won't pass until the last PR of the stack.
